*PPD-Adobe: "4.3"
*% SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-or-later
*% PPD for YHK / JieLi "cat" Bluetooth thermal printers (54 mm roll,
*% 48 mm / 384-dot printable width, 203 dpi, ESC/POS raster).
*% Page sizes are the printable area: what you design is what prints.
*FormatVersion: "4.3"
*FileVersion: "1.0"
*LanguageVersion: English
*LanguageEncoding: ISOLatin1
*PCFileName: "YHKCAT.PPD"
*Manufacturer: "YHK"
*Product: "(YHK Cat Printer)"
*ModelName: "YHK Cat Printer"
*ShortNickName: "YHK Cat Printer 54mm"
*NickName: "YHK Cat Printer 54mm (ESC/POS raster)"
*PSVersion: "(3010.000) 0"
*LanguageLevel: "3"
*ColorDevice: False
*DefaultColorSpace: Gray
*FileSystem: False
*Throughput: "1"
*LandscapeOrientation: Plus90
*TTRasterizer: Type42
*cupsVersion: 2.4
*cupsModelNumber: 0
*cupsManualCopies: True
*cupsFilter: "application/vnd.cups-raster 0 rastertoyhk"

*OpenUI *PageSize/Label Size: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageSize
*DefaultPageSize: Label48x48mm
*PageSize Label48x20mm/48 x 20 mm: "<</PageSize[136.06 56.69]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Label48x30mm/48 x 30 mm: "<</PageSize[136.06 85.04]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Label48x40mm/48 x 40 mm: "<</PageSize[136.06 113.39]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Label48x48mm/48 x 48 mm (square): "<</PageSize[136.06 136.06]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Label48x50mm/48 x 50 mm: "<</PageSize[136.06 141.73]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Label48x60mm/48 x 60 mm: "<</PageSize[136.06 170.08]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Label48x80mm/48 x 80 mm: "<</PageSize[136.06 226.77]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Label48x100mm/48 x 100 mm: "<</PageSize[136.06 283.46]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageSize

*OpenUI *PageRegion: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageRegion
*DefaultPageRegion: Label48x48mm
*PageRegion Label48x20mm/48 x 20 mm: "<</PageSize[136.06 56.69]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Label48x30mm/48 x 30 mm: "<</PageSize[136.06 85.04]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Label48x40mm/48 x 40 mm: "<</PageSize[136.06 113.39]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Label48x48mm/48 x 48 mm (square): "<</PageSize[136.06 136.06]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Label48x50mm/48 x 50 mm: "<</PageSize[136.06 141.73]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Label48x60mm/48 x 60 mm: "<</PageSize[136.06 170.08]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Label48x80mm/48 x 80 mm: "<</PageSize[136.06 226.77]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Label48x100mm/48 x 100 mm: "<</PageSize[136.06 283.46]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageRegion

*DefaultImageableArea: Label48x48mm
*ImageableArea Label48x20mm: "0 0 136.06 56.69"
*ImageableArea Label48x30mm: "0 0 136.06 85.04"
*ImageableArea Label48x40mm: "0 0 136.06 113.39"
*ImageableArea Label48x48mm: "0 0 136.06 136.06"
*ImageableArea Label48x50mm: "0 0 136.06 141.73"
*ImageableArea Label48x60mm: "0 0 136.06 170.08"
*ImageableArea Label48x80mm: "0 0 136.06 226.77"
*ImageableArea Label48x100mm: "0 0 136.06 283.46"

*DefaultPaperDimension: Label48x48mm
*PaperDimension Label48x20mm: "136.06 56.69"
*PaperDimension Label48x30mm: "136.06 85.04"
*PaperDimension Label48x40mm: "136.06 113.39"
*PaperDimension Label48x48mm: "136.06 136.06"
*PaperDimension Label48x50mm: "136.06 141.73"
*PaperDimension Label48x60mm: "136.06 170.08"
*PaperDimension Label48x80mm: "136.06 226.77"
*PaperDimension Label48x100mm: "136.06 283.46"

*% Custom sizes, e.g. lp -o media=Custom.48x70mm
*VariablePaperSize: True
*MaxMediaWidth: "136.06"
*MaxMediaHeight: "8503.94"
*HWMargins: 0 0 0 0
*CustomPageSize True: "pop pop pop <</PageSize[5 -2 roll]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*ParamCustomPageSize Width: 1 points 28.35 136.06
*ParamCustomPageSize Height: 2 points 28.35 8503.94
*ParamCustomPageSize WidthOffset: 3 points 0 0
*ParamCustomPageSize HeightOffset: 4 points 0 0
*ParamCustomPageSize Orientation: 5 int 0 0

*OpenUI *Resolution/Resolution: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *Resolution
*DefaultResolution: 203dpi
*Resolution 203dpi/203 dpi: "<</HWResolution[203 203]>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *Resolution

*OpenUI *ColorModel/Color Mode: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *ColorModel
*DefaultColorModel: Gray
*ColorModel Gray/Grayscale: "<</cupsColorSpace 0/cupsColorOrder 0/cupsBitsPerColor 8>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *ColorModel

*% The options below are read by rastertoyhk itself.
*OpenUI *Dither/Halftoning: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 30 AnySetup *Dither
*DefaultDither: FloydSteinberg
*Dither FloydSteinberg/Floyd-Steinberg (photos): ""
*Dither Threshold/Threshold (text, QR codes): ""
*CloseUI: *Dither

*OpenUI *FeedAfter/Paper Feed After Job: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 30 AnySetup *FeedAfter
*DefaultFeedAfter: 10mm
*FeedAfter 0mm/None: ""
*FeedAfter 5mm/5 mm: ""
*FeedAfter 8mm/8 mm: ""
*FeedAfter 10mm/10 mm: ""
*FeedAfter 12mm/12 mm: ""
*FeedAfter 15mm/15 mm: ""
*FeedAfter 20mm/20 mm: ""
*FeedAfter 30mm/30 mm: ""
*FeedAfter 40mm/40 mm: ""
*CloseUI: *FeedAfter

*OpenUI *PageGap/Gap Between Labels: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 30 AnySetup *PageGap
*DefaultPageGap: 4mm
*PageGap 0mm/None: ""
*PageGap 2mm/2 mm: ""
*PageGap 4mm/4 mm: ""
*PageGap 8mm/8 mm: ""
*PageGap 16mm/16 mm: ""
*CloseUI: *PageGap

*DefaultFont: Courier
*Font Courier: Standard "(002.004S)" Standard ROM
